        "Description": "Good evening, 47.\r\rHelmut Kruger sued Jason Portman for identity theft after Portman&apos;s surgery got leaked to the public. While Kruger had plenty of evidence to prove Portman&apos;s guilt, Portman&apos;s corrupt fleet of lawyers &quot;convinced&quot; the judge of Portman&apos;s innocence.\r\rKruger has lost a fortune in stocks in his modelling agency, and has therefore asked us to get rid of Portman once and for all.\r\rI will leave you to prepare.",
